# Line endings (aifactory RQ-0075): every text file is LF in the repository
# and in every checkout, Windows too. Vivado, Tcl and shell scripts want LF,
# and `factory template update` then sees no difference made by line endings
# alone (Git's core.autocrlf on Windows checks files out with CRLF otherwise).
* text=auto eol=lf
# Windows batch files keep CRLF, as cmd.exe expects.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
